# NeoBench program entry -- see Tools/Clock for what the "program ="
# line does and Tools/NeoText for where the convention started.
#
# The system monitor goes in the tools drawer beside the clock, because
# it is the other half of reading the machine: one says what the time
# is, the other says what the machine is doing with it.  A toolbox that
# held one and not the other would be a toolbox with a gap in it.
#
# It is started from here rather than from the start menu, so it is
# one press from a drawer that has been opened anyway.

program = monitor
